; ============================================================================
; AD BYZANTINE MICRO / FORMATION / TACTICAL EXECUTION DIRECTOR
; ============================================================================
; The sword-hand.
;
; Mission:
;   Turn a strategically correct army into a tactically correct army.
;
; This director does NOT attempt to recreate the game's entire native Group
; Micro system in .per code. AoE2 DE already has native Extreme Group Micro,
; including group focus fire, hit-and-run, local advantage evaluation, flank
; formation behavior, missile dodging and siege-vs-siege movement. This module
; steers those native systems with Byzantine doctrine and protects them from
; strategic mistakes.
;
; Dissertation doctrine implemented here:
;   - evaluate engagements by BattleValue, not kill count;
;   - minimum effective mass and correct positioning;
;   - Halberdiers guard valuable targets instead of chasing cavalry;
;   - Skirmishers kite, focus fire and screen siege/Cataphracts;
;   - Camels hit-and-run against cavalry;
;   - Cataphracts attack infantry/trash and avoid mass ranged fire;
;   - Monks heal/convert from behind the line;
;   - siege requires a sufficient protection screen;
;   - preserve the army when the local fight becomes economically negative;
;   - exploit local tactical advantage without overextending the strategic army.
;
; The director therefore controls:
;   local tactical posture, pursuit discipline, siege protection, reserve,
;   formation-distance proxy, target-evaluation emphasis, missile-dodge/kiting
;   support, retreat authority, pressure/pursuit mode and tactical lock.
;
; It uses only commands / strategic numbers already present in the uploaded
; Promisory AI and/or documented DE AI scripting interfaces.
; ============================================================================

